<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair July load factor down to 70.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Swissair July load factor down to 70.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair Schweizerische Luftverkehr AG said its load factor fell to 70.8 percent in July from 71.4 percent in the same month last year.</p>
<p>Swissair gave following details:</p>
<p>					July 1996   vs  July 1995</p>
<p> Total load factor		 70.8 pct   vs   71.4 pct</p>
<p> Passenger load factor	   70.5 pct   vs   69.8 pct</p>
<p> Passengers carried		797,577    vs   791,898</p>
<p>A Swissair statement also gave following details in thousands of tonnes kilometres (tkm):</p>
<p>					July 1996   vs  July 1995</p>
<p> Available tkm		     486,526    vs   447,540</p>
<p> Total revenue tkm		 344,351    vs   319,594</p>
<p> Passenger revenue tkm	   206,758    vs   187,305</p>
<p> Mail/Cargo revenue tkm	  137,593    vs   132,289</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
